From 214b9c7aba45d46e952707d7928132df03cbb009 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Trevor Wong <149596139+TronJuan@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 18:23:37 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] gmail_imap: app-password connect, multiple accounts,
 incremental sync

- `jarvis connect gmail_imap` asks for an email and app password instead of
  starting an OAuth flow that has no provider.
- Several Gmail accounts can be stored and synced; each email is tagged
  with the account it came from.
- Optional `since_days` and `uid_floors` so frequent polls fetch only new mail.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
